    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Dawn_of_Defiance\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Dawn of Defiance\">Star Wars Saga Edition Dawn of Defiance</a> (<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/A_Wretched_Hive\" title=\"A Wretched Hive\">A Wretched Hive</a>)</i> </p><p>The Vipers, a rough gang of thugs who terrorize Zarra on a daily basis, always look for fresh prey when an outlander starship arrives. The swoop gang's leader is a violent <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a> woman named Kessra. She is the only female member of the gang, but she bears the scars of several past battles. </p><p>From the Vipers' demeanor, it is clear that they follow her unquestioningly. However, they don't realize that Kessra sometimes takes small jobs from Darga the Hutt. She uses her gang to achieve the crime lord's goals in Zarra. </p><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Viper_Heroic_Units\">Viper Heroic Units</span></h2><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Heroic_Units\" title=\"Heroic Units\">Heroic Units</a></i> </p><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>NAME </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>AFFILIATION NOTES </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dawn of Defiance\">Dawn of Defiance</a> </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Kessra\" title=\"Kessra\">Kessra</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 2 </td> \n   <td><i>This slender <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a> woman is clearly a veteran of many battles, as she has numerous scars and marks of combat across her face, arms, and hands.</i> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Viper_Nonheroic_Units\">Viper Nonheroic Units</span></h2><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Nonheroic_Units\" title=\"Nonheroic Units\">Nonheroic Units</a></i> </p><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>NAME </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>AFFILIATION NOTES </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dawn of Defiance\">Dawn of Defiance</a> </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Viper_Swoop_Gang_Member\" title=\"Viper Swoop Gang Member\">Viper Swoop Gang Member</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 2 </td> \n   <td><i>One of the grinning thugs clutches a battered <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vibroblade\" title=\"Vibroblade\">Vibroblade</a> in one hand while revving the engine of his Swoop Bike with the other.</i> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Viper_Vehicles\">Viper Vehicles</span></h2><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicles\" title=\"Vehicles\">Vehicles</a></i> </p><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>NAME </th> \n   <th>VEHICLE TYPE </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <th colspan=\"4\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dawn of Defiance\">Dawn of Defiance</a> </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Viper_Swoop_Bike\" title=\"Viper Swoop Bike\">Viper Swoop Bike</a> </td> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Speeder\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Speeder\">Speeder</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 2 </td> \n   <td><i>Image Unavailable</i> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table>",
